Source: postgresql-semver
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/theory/pg-semver

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-semver
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Semantic version data type for PostgreSQL
 semver implements the Semantic Versioning 2.0.0 format as a PostgreSQL data
 type with comparison operators and support for btree and hash indexes.
